g is active, based on data from 23 customers who completed the full implementation program. Results may vary by carrier type, lane density, and baseline TMS maturity.\"\n\n[Source 4 — Transport Topics, \"Logistics M&A Activity 2023–2024,\" January 2025]\nExcerpt: \"M&A deal count in logistics technology reached 87 transactions in 2023 and an estimated 94 in 2024. Whether these levels represent a historical record depends on how 'logistics technology' is defined — earlier data using broader SIC-code definitions suggested comparable or higher volumes in 2015–2016.\"\n\n---\nProduce: (1) revised brief, (2) unsupported-claims log."